{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "db4e4d4d7ec5a41257c3b0ec721e86af5fe7f8c3a7ffe6b6f70a6e94da41a275", "ja": "これからもアイドルに向かって", "zh": "今后也朝着偶像的目标", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d844a8f73d29683bf343bde471f65e2c0bcb9d26b02fe0870d2a6cde60f225ac", "ja": "新衣装に袖を通して心躍らせる静香。\n自分の夢が叶ったことについて改めて礼を\n述べ、そしてこの先は、どんなアイドルに\nなるのか探しに行くつもりだと語る。\n怖くはない、だってみんなと一緒だから！", "zh": "穿上新服装后，静香的心雀跃不已。  \n她再次对自己的梦想得以实现表达了谢意，  \n并说道，今后打算去寻找自己会成为怎样的偶像。  \n一点也不可怕，因为有大家陪在身边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c961fd833cd18a91f742dd35e032d15c07c85d0186c69ab9391b7ec2f8eddef6", "ja": "第1回定期公演用の衣装合わせ……", "zh": "第1次定期公演的服装搭配……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "5e72878c7404562d2613c03842b41bafc3bc79bbfbe8c475e7d038b83d70ce23", "ja": "あの……。\nどうですか、プロデューサー？", "zh": "那个……\n制作人，觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "58225a3e8c768de8588bb276bae7d8a806eac1eecda75c5b72e4ba5c1d8841b7", "ja": "うん、新しい衣装もよく似合ってる。\nバッチリだな！", "zh": "嗯，新服装也很适合你。\n非常完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "788010e8ff5a165a3d8a93bc8476c8482569e640664e680b1d9387750bf7461e", "ja": "そ、そうですよねっ。よかった……。\nでも、なんだか……すごいですね。", "zh": "是、是这样吧。太好了……\n不过，总觉得……很厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "0de5fdc17ddd9ca5ebc477327178bce4f9f4aede7b93b78dfd2d9ed300457dbc", "ja": "？　何がすごいんだ？", "zh": "？什么很厉害？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "cec06c95668c077c4483bfef480524f48b40c7ad61c8e576a5c3f75dd33bb5d0", "ja": "衣装です。私達、まだMILLIONSTARSの衣装を\nもらったばかりなのに、もう新しい衣装なんて。", "zh": "是服装。我们才刚拿到MILLIONSTARS的服装，\n怎么这么快就又有新服装了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "1c17d699c735093b51e44b611e84da5b044137d49ead6c4f78ab591352399c11", "ja": "なんていうか……贅沢だなって。", "zh": "该怎么说呢……感觉有点奢侈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "0dc071d02434029a540e3a93111e185661a3a534e7230fd6c58b94c497ff4d3c", "ja": "はは、まだ2着目じゃないか。こんなの序の口だぞ？\nこれから数え切れない衣装が、静香を待ってるからな！", "zh": "哈哈，这才是第2套而已。这种程度还只是开始哦？\n今后还有数不清的服装在等着静香呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "a7e51ff86831bf7199d59cd35fee45ba892e77c5b1268fc0c0f49d5ecc75b61e", "ja": "そんなに……！　ふふっ、楽しみにしてます！\n他のチームの衣装も、みんな素敵でしたよね。", "zh": "那么多……！呵呵，我很期待哦！\n其他队伍的服装也都很棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "1810ace82be90e95525691b05e5e657bf953c08060a02eacb4b7d216d25b4231", "ja": "1stはすごくかっこよくて、\n2ndはかわいい、アイドル水着風で……。", "zh": "1st非常帅气，\n2nd则是可爱的偶像泳装风……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "0fb66b36e957ec174f6763a6444657320673397df3c87ef1d01b4ab5c145bf11", "ja": "はっ！\nわ、私もいつか……？", "zh": "啊！\n我、我也总有一天……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "57aa9c7469cbb9f71eaacec1298a83dfaada7fd99271cd4f57bb9bb960c51a49", "ja": "？　……ああ、もしかして、\nアイドル水着風がいいのか？", "zh": "？……啊，难道你想要偶像泳装风格的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "8da6a310b61b55d48b2d1fd355dbd8fe3eda34cfd93ded3ecaf9fec0711d93b2", "ja": "べ、別に希望はしてません！\n勝手に決めないでください！", "zh": "我、我可没这么希望！\n别擅自替我决定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "e3d9a563a5eac541cb1ea651e8d143570d119d1f1aa4d05a8ea9c2a6ed2c75aa", "ja": "そういえばプロデューサーって、最初からそういう\n感じでしたよね。デリカシーにかけるっていうか……。", "zh": "说起来，制作人从一开始就是那种感觉呢。该说是缺乏敏感度吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "2d3adaa44ba930ea056673cede901737c7ad2d528e498421c744eb44e913ff85", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　いやコンプラ研修は受けたし、\nいちおう気をつけてるつもりなんだけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？我参加过合规培训了，也算是一直在注意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "09372232f6ae6f83e8b8774ac857033543388b8fce0494211afe882c641c15bc", "ja": "……翼とデートするとか言ってました。前に。", "zh": "……之前还说过要和翼去约会什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "d5730505902cd9808e2479ac5417dbc10f0dcf6152614384acfc69cb875b03b8", "ja": "はっ。あ、あれは誤解だから！\nデートではなく、ただの……打ち合わせです。", "zh": "哈。啊、那是误会！不是约会，只是……商量事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "5a20a881f5fcb1cc3eaa2405558c2443ad940769efb59d3f159bfe499c0e184f", "ja": "本当かな……。", "zh": "真的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "c188bd6c39fcf48cb1959c4ca3769b706892ab254e74e466edde6653c9dc40ed", "ja": "本当です……。コホン、それより衣装！\n動いても大丈夫か、ちゃんと確認しておいてくれよ！", "zh": "是真的……咳咳，比起这个，还是服装要紧！\n你可要好好确认一下，就算活动也没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "bb38979d73116c290c08a49d50221f75b0acef5ed948d0b72914135f26510c7f", "ja": "あっ、そうでしたっ！", "zh": "啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1021_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "a1f7e56bee48945581b5bf6dd43784db156e8a944d406a273935c7d2c372507e", "ja": "あの、もう少し腰回りをきつくしてほしいです。\nその方が安定する気がして……。", "zh": "那个，腰部周围能不能再收紧一点？\n我觉得那样会更稳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "e3c6802b659cddcee6ab2db8d979b9b9da42e6f09f2bd86f789aeb889ffb0ffe", "ja": "わかった、青羽さんに調整してもらおう。\n他は大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "明白了，我请青羽小姐帮忙调整一下。\n其他地方应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "620158842b5c2e3573d9c26cd68b9054041e38e6bf5b8428a7fce916bb4c5779", "ja": "はい。歌もダンスも、いけると思います。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得唱歌和跳舞应该都没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "50e8ac3e110230a8d21b342dbf2464861066d11001bec8bb4ebd077f21d53882", "ja": "よし！　じゃあアイドルとして、ステージで\nしっかり輝けそうだな。楽しみにしてるぞ！", "zh": "好！那么作为偶像，应该能在舞台上好好闪耀了。期待你的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "1a5317b952af42524eb1d9b2d28a71b163ba88fc87f538fb9a77ae7c9999c138", "ja": "！　は、はい……。\n…………。", "zh": "！是、是的……。\n…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "a10ff7124d8fd18cb03a3e2f88416d81d0eb9ec13837453eb9aba4d6e52ac9c5", "ja": "？　……どうした？", "zh": "？……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "9cb5efc549f3a10b801cdd00230701c040fc18105ac8f7b3c5614721ed2fc76f", "ja": "あ、あの……。\n一度、ちゃんと言わなきゃって思ってて……。", "zh": "啊，那个……\n我一直想着，必须好好说一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "c2558d9df265169e981dce6fd2a57fdc6c844f1db573af6c85b6d97f71dbe8fd", "ja": "私の夢がかなって……アイドルになれたのは、\nプロデューサーのおかげです。だから……。", "zh": "我的梦想实现了……我也成为了偶像，\n这都多亏了制作人。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "eaa8b6814859bc306a4051e299c665ad2d005fbbdab63312183f140b148ed8f5", "ja": "プロデューサー。\nありがとうございました！", "zh": "制作人。\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "2b5a0cb0f55905d755d432ea829006985a08080aa81991f30334f184688d175e", "ja": "お礼なんていいよ、これが仕事なんだし。……それに、\n静香は自分で夢を掴んだんだ。俺のおかげじゃない。", "zh": "不用道谢，这本来就是我的工作。……而且，\n静香是靠自己抓住梦想的。这可不是我的功劳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "e196402c2befac231a0c78f97605cf8a09fe3c6e7f5f29361dd321dd309140d6", "ja": "でも、言いたかったんです。\nあと、今度の定期公演も、父が来てくれるみたいで。", "zh": "但是，我还是想告诉您。\n而且，听说这次的定期公演，父亲也会来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "3df916f3c5cc3bf6900805a1520766f7491ba59310700453f9c576b36bab1858", "ja": "！　そうか……よかった。\nすっかり応援してくれてるんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……那就好。看来已经完全支持你了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "822d374087061299dcf8b632b137b02573374140b9fc566cf735cd336c67f48c", "ja": "どうでしょう。よく分かりませんけど。", "zh": "怎么样呢？我也不太清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "ba013f66dfbd999fdaf4d783944e2e46b81efc3dc89cc11e9aeeae67d2cf01c7", "ja": "でも、なんだか……。\n嬉しいです。", "zh": "不过，总觉得……  \n我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1036_401pro", "source_sha256": "bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed", "ja": "……うん。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "511a8127a2d15474ac3c9b579dd874c5ab652543b9eabd0e4e90dde787901b57", "ja": "アイドルを続けられることになって……。\n定期公演も始まって。", "zh": "能够继续当偶像了……\n定期公演也开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "ffaeef3e208bf8a02b43e55a823d57963276bad767cff7abfaeb526887fdf267", "ja": "この先、どんなことをして行くのか……\nどんなアイドルになるのか、まだ想像できませんけど。", "zh": "今后要做些什么……\n要成为怎样的偶像，我还无法想象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "b6863b9dc30e81f0a539f38297e4d18e370dece9212a8eaa84ec5132e24ce78a", "ja": "だからこそ、探しに行きます。\n私の、これからを。", "zh": "正因如此，我才要去寻找。\n寻找属于我的未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "12c92b8a6707ece5d2d7128a313a8f945c14440542f0c0920500f9d8bbbf700f", "ja": "また立ち止まったり、迷ったりするかも\nしれませんけど……もう怖くありません。", "zh": "也许还会再次停下脚步，感到迷茫……但我已经不害怕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "4c7cca2ff439434f17c6f8d30c15bbee3c12578cfb2458ff3a77bd8a6187f112", "ja": "……みんなと一緒だから。", "zh": "……因为有大家陪在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1042_401pro", "source_sha256": "777a28e905055c31390b5808f03bb4542fc1494a2b87beaf7b10edfa9b2b90f3", "ja": "ああ。一緒に探しに行こう。\nこれからの静香の……みんなの夢を。", "zh": "啊。一起去寻找吧。\n今后的静香的……以及大家的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_04_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "aa9f8a4ed7593c969a65b858d74aa7eb6fddcf1cd70d4e0b48cb83a74b6c29a7", "ja": "はいっ！　これからも、\nよろしくお願いしますね、プロデューサー！", "zh": "好的！今后也请多多关照，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
